    "notes": [
      "Players who completed statues between <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/12_April\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">12 April</a> and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/8_May\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">8 May</a> <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/2016\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">2016</a> received an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Early_Bird_Bonus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Early Bird Bonus</a>. Paying respects at each of the statues granted 1/40 of the total fixed experience rewarded from the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Myreque_quest_series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Myreque quest series</a>. Players could choose whether to gain combat experience or not when paying respects for the first time. The early bird reward for one statue was:",
